{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_3_30002_01_d",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:501c06e0562cb25a4ec3ea8949a28be610e2dc319ec950700948d258f2fa26e3",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_d:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0e5afa06ce6d3ad6d1b391da1ebe59c6f9e9a04648ec588c19f507db6d0bfbbc",
      "text": "哇啊，好怀念……\n这本漫画，是那时候很火的吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_d:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:337cffc77f280eec5289ae31f8adbfb04e81a3f44eaf103aaaf00177f627e659",
      "text": "啊，快看。这难道是相册？\n还有修学旅行的照片呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_d:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1763c99ff0ddef612125057d1ab21f1a849092b97fd6be03e0c2a366c4ca4982",
      "text": "这张photo上的人，是Mr. 山下？\n相当年轻呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_d:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cd81858f6c5ab5a11adc6cad99525e5fd15582cef4dffece22203a622d87187f",
      "text": "还好吧？\n说明我也是有过那种年轻气盛的岁月的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_d:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1c18f9467ba8636e94422fad0a6168cb0212679c9203116cdfd0100e7906ed83",
      "text": "……那个，硲老师。你知道这本笔记本是谁的吗？\n我们大家都没什么印象。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_d:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4b6ec59791c0af6666b182909bdecf392a0e85a360d4f9f468d968f799f9c17b",
      "text": "唔，让我看看。……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_d:cmd-000079:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:63e9e97dcbefeb2d945f3374fe313a5f05329840d0cf0c2a75e1fe0a47b790a9",
      "text": "Oh……字太多了看得我头晕眼花……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_d:cmd-000088:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bd690f42133f69bd00867c15b864606be18da08bff9aba030d77848ee74e6b6c",
      "text": "教师型机器人硲引领主角成为巨星……\n这是小说？与其说是小说，不如说是电视剧剧本吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_d:cmd-000097:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e3e5bec585afd1aeea21bb2d0997d2bc6c3deb449b9b9616aaf96a0fdf6d3eef",
      "text": "看来是的。\n这个“硲”，指的应该是我吧……嗯？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_d:cmd-000103:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:327141f90a74fdc5c810d531bea5eb6a362dff5e62f1d19bd98b551d44695320",
      "text": "虽然字迹有些模糊，但这里写着名字。\n我记得他应该是……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_d:cmd-000107:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5748cf4f083f12946109f8a25526c28eed40143041a8538da35f2ea333c1e63b",
      "text": "哦，您知道是谁的笔记本了吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_d:cmd-000117:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d001bb964b5beeff39282cacf03bc63eb618745d761d8ccfadba8868a57642bc",
      "text": "嗯。不过，他今天好像没有过来。\n我记得他就住在附近才对……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_d:cmd-000126:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d2d47b54e92d41a1c46175e5fc774fda3895be3f0158a22bbb032791cf69afc7",
      "text": "既然这样，那本notebook就由我们去送还给他吧♪",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
